iris-verifier licence
=====================

This directory is NOT covered by the Apache 2.0 licence that applies to the
rest of this repository.

Yivi's own source code here (everything outside `third_party/`) is published so
that the Iris face verification method can be read, reviewed and audited. You
may do all of those things, and you may modify it.

You may NOT run this service, or any image built from it, unless you hold your
own licence with the manufacturer of the Iris library from
https://passportreader.app. The service does nothing without that library: it
is the face detection, matching and liveness engine. It is proprietary, it is
owned by the manufacturer rather than by Yivi, and no rights to it are granted
here by anyone.

The archive is published as a release asset of this repository with the
manufacturer's explicit permission. That permission covers publication only. It
is not a licence to use the library, and downloading the archive does not give
you one.

Built images of this service contain the library statically linked, so the same
restriction follows them wherever they go.

For a licence, contact the manufacturer at https://passportreader.app.
